<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine firms buy 40,000 T of U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>Philippine firms buy 40,000 T of U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine firms bought 40,000 tonnes of U.S. wheat for February shipment, traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;We bought wheat shortly after the United States Department of Agriculture released its grains forecast for 1997 late on Friday,&quot; a traders in one of the firms told Reuters.</p>
<p>The price at which the wheat was bought was not immediately available.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
